{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And now.</b> Its Mishnaic form, like לשכים in your eyes (Numbers 33:55)." "<b>To graze.</b> To pasture, like ובער בשדה אחר (Exodus 22:4)." "And the sense of <b>break down its wall</b> is that the walls will fall."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {0 "The lemma ועתה is Hebrew script preserved from the verse; the comparison is to the Mishnaic Hebrew word לשכים cited in the Numbers verse."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:52:11.558597874Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}